  "$comment": "Bubaly design tokens — the single source of truth shared by the web app (app/globals.css + tailwind.config.ts, kept in sync by tests/design-tokens.test.ts) and the Expo mobile app (mobile/src/theme). Colors are RGB triples so both CSS `rgb(var(--x) / alpha)` and React Native color strings can be derived from one value.",
